   "en": "A machine fills **1000 ml** bottles; σ = 10 ml is known. On **n = 16** bottles, **x̄ = 995 ml**.\n\n**a)** At α = 5 %, is the machine out of adjustment?\n**b)** Same at α = 1 %.\n**c)** Compute the P-value and recover both decisions.\n\nGiven: z0.025 = 1.96; z0.005 = 2.576; Φ(2) = 0.9772."
